src/flybrain_robot/track/connectome/ contains code adapted from the beedictor
research project (connectome engine, CSR controls, retinotopy, retina encoder and
T4/T5 cursor readout), included by this fork's owner. Each adapted file names
its original path in a header comment. The colour gain constant (white = 1.398, Rh1) was computed there from the
Govardovskii et al. (2000) visual pigment template.

Connectome data is not distributed. Users of the connectome backend must obtain
FlyWire (FAFB) and Janelia MaleCNS data under their respective terms.
